<title>AUSTRIA: Bank Austria share trade to resume Thurs.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria share trade to resume Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares and participation certificates in Bank Austria will resume trading on the Vienna stock exchange on Thursday after a one-day suspension, Bank Austria spokesman Heimo Hackel said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Vienna stock exchange halted trade in Bank Austria on Wednesday ahead of an important announcement.</p>
<p>After a supervisory board meeting, Bank Austria said it would bid for the state's 70 percent stake in the Creditanstalt-Bankverein. -- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
</text>
